NOTICE

This entry reimplements the `makefun-site` reference program shipped in the
site-generator-speed-01 bounty kit (program/generator/vendor/makefun-site/),
which is make.fun's own static site generator. The reference program's header
credits its upstreams (metalsmith's plugin shape and marked's lexer/parser
shape); this port follows the same rules and produces the same output.

The Go engine in `sitegen` is an original implementation written for this
entry. It uses only the Go standard library plus golang.org/x/text (NFKD
normalisation for slugs), under their respective licences.
